<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Norbake yr shr, div rises.</title>
<headline>Norbake yr shr, div rises.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-12-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended September 30</p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>Shr, (cts)</p>
<p>    - attrib		  11.23	 vs 7.22</p>
<p>    - headline		11.70	 vs 7.38</p>
<p>    Div (cts)		 4.00	  vs 2.50</p>
<p>    Attrib income	   6.42	  vs 4.13</p>
<p>    Pre-tax		   10.08	 vs 6.18</p>
<p>    Tax			 3.66	  vs 2.69</p>
<p>    Interest paid	   1.99	  vs 1.90</p>
<p>    Turnover		  251.91	vs 221.68</p>
<p>Div payable January 24</p>
<p>on register January 3</p>
<p>Full name: Northern Bakeries Ltd</p>
<p>NOTE - Directors said they were confident the steady increase in profitability experienced in the past financial year would continue in the next period.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
